\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Extended Trailer is an extended version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Trailer\" title=\"Basic Trailer\">Basic Trailer</a>, hence the name. It is even wider than the widest vehicle in the game, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sellner_Explorer\" title=\"Sellner Explorer\">Sellner Explorer</a>. It has an internal volume of 7&#215;3.5&#215;20.5 studs.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163205\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019500/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.182      1 Template:Vehicles\n100.00%   36.182      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1234-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163205 and revision id 14007. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Vehicles"],"links":[{"title":"Basic Trailer","exists":true},{"title":"Sellner Explorer","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Ext_Trailer.png","Extended_Trailer.png"]}
